{"ticker":"RJF","updated":"2026-10-30T23:09:33Z","profile":{"longName":"Raymond James Financial, Inc.","shortName":"Raymond James Financial, Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Asset Management","country":"United States","website":"https://www.raymondjames.com","fullTimeEmployees":null,"marketCap":30201962496,"trailingPE":13.200672,"forwardPE":9.671685,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.9087381,"pegRatio":0.79,"targetMeanPrice":182.14285,"targetHighPrice":205.0,"targetLowPrice":160.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":14,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.157,"earningsGrowth":0.15,"grossMargins":0.93294996,"operatingMargins":0.21136999,"profitMargins":0.14965999,"totalRevenue":15822999552,"beta":0.946,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":182.73,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":138.82,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.34},"summary":"Raymond James Financial, Inc., a diversified financial services company, provides private client group, capital markets, asset management, banking, and other services to individuals, corporations, and municipalities in the United States, Canada, and Europe. The Private Client Group segment offers financial planning, investment advisory, securities transaction, investment services, portfolio management services, insurance and annuity products, and mutual funds; support to third-party mutual fund and annuity companies, including sales and marketing support, as well as distribution and accounting, and administrative services; margin loans; securities borrowing and lending services; and custodial, trade execution, research, and other support and services. The Capital Markets segment provides investment banking services, such as equity and debt underwriting, and merger and acquisition advisory; and fixed income and equity brokerage services. This segment also offers institutional sales, securities trading, equity research, and the syndication and management of investments in low-income housing funds and funds of a similar nature. The Asset Management segment provides asset management, portfolio management, and related administrative services to retail and institutional clients; and administrative support services, such as record-keeping. The Bank segment offers various types of loan","summary_zh":"Raymond James Financial, Inc. 是一家多元化的金融服務公司，為美國、加拿大和歐洲的個人、公司和市政當局提供私人客戶群、資本市場、資產管理、銀行和其他服務。私人客戶集團部門提供財務規劃、投資諮詢、證券交易、投資服務、投資組合管理服務、保險和年金產品以及共同基金；對第三方共同基金和年金公司的支持，包括銷售和營銷支持，以及分銷和會計以及行政服務；保證金貸款；證券借貸服務；以及託管、交易執行、研究以及其他支持和服務。資本市場部門提供投資銀行服務，例如股權和債務承銷以及併購諮詢；以及固定收益和股票經紀服務。該部門還提供機構銷售、證券交易、股票研究以及低收入住房基金和類似性質基金投資的聯合和管理。資產管理部門為零售和機構客戶提供資產管理、投資組合管理和相關管理服務；行政支援服務，例如記錄保存。銀行部門提供各種類型的貸款","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"資產管理","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":167.74,"h":168.59,"l":165.48,"c":168.32,"v":996100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":167.79,"h":168.41,"l":165.48,"c":166.56,"v":702200},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":167.59,"h":171.25,"l":167.2,"c":171.09,"v":888500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":171.0,"h":171.18,"l":163.21,"c":165.5,"v":1293500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":165.14,"h":166.08,"l":164.43,"c":165.77,"v":969100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":165.12,"h":167.15,"l":165.12,"c":165.59,"v":486000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":165.51,"h":167.81,"l":164.59,"c":166.7,"v":578000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":167.37,"h":171.1,"l":166.86,"c":171.08,"v":1472700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":170.86,"h":171.45,"l":169.36,"c":170.27,"v":1188300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":170.33,"h":172.05,"l":168.23,"c":168.26,"v":1583500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":168.07,"h":169.63,"l":166.89,"c":169.07,"v":1173200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":169.01,"h":171.8,"l":168.45,"c":170.07,"v":1017400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":170.6,"h":174.85,"l":170.2,"c":173.93,"v":942000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":174.18,"h":175.27,"l":171.95,"c":174.06,"v":3059700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":173.09,"h":176.65,"l":172.44,"c":175.32,"v":1050000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":174.94,"h":177.66,"l":174.6,"c":175.81,"v":907500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":176.09,"h":177.01,"l":171.55,"c":171.91,"v":1535100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":170.81,"h":173.73,"