l":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOUVp6b1pZU1JEX1FEUmZIZ2ZINndGOTdrYTdieVlrY3pkYUU1MUZIb0RuRlZhU09GYUZfekczZERxN3I3bEZzbERaaUROb1pQaHd5VTJUV3BOUnZnUGpkSTRBM0pwWm9oOFJoYmhOOHkza1UwRkVmRnotQks0RFJXdEVsUy05T09PaHBsb0FGMkp5YWZZeTFwc0ZHdkE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Raymond James Financial Inc (RJF) 2026 年第四季財報電話會議亮點：創紀錄的收入，1 美元。 ……"},{"title":"Raymond James Financial (NYSE:RJF) Stock Gets Price Target Reduction from Wells Fargo & Company","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"富國銀行下調 Raymond James Financial （NYSE：RJF）股票目標價"},{"title":"[Raymond James Financial Q4 2026 Earnings Call] Record $4.27B Revenue, 88% Surge in Net New Assets; Plans to Resume $400M Quarterly Buybacks","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE10b1FjUGFET1JUekVSbG1CLVFVYmx1d0QyQWRNVy1Wd3FvSjVnd1Rla2NUclhpaUtZSVpJdjZIczM3bk5QUjF2OUdvdzBDUkRhRlNhMTE5RWtQOUFx?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"[Raymond James Financial 2026 年第四季財報電話會議] 營收創紀錄的 $4.27B，淨新資產激增 88%；計畫恢復 4 億美元的季度回購"},{"title":"Raymond James Financial beats estimates on record revenue","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPYVREaFluelRiMU92WlBjeUhOMDFPQ1FwcHVQdmtfR3BGUWxpazR3WEQ3UkxaajFDeDJHaUtEUThIM0lGekx3X3RnQVdFZVR2bFRRY3hNRzBycmVXTUlXc254Ukk5VmpoTFpKT3Vtdjc0TWNsVEx5UU04b2ZqLTA5MDZxS3ZmeWxiZDBMQTF2NmprR2FCajNEUUR6ZTlGb2laWTdnWlFBZw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"雷蒙德詹姆斯金融公司營收創歷史新高，超乎預期"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":9},{"name":"分析師評等","count":5},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2025-11-25","period":"2025-09-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/720005/000072000525000093/rjf-20250930.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Raymond James Financial, Inc. (\"RJF\" or the \"firm\") is a leading diversified financial services company providing private client group, capital markets, asset management, banking and other services to individuals, corporations, and municipalities. The firm, together with its subsidiaries, is engaged in various financial services activities, including providing investment management services to retail and institutional clients, merger & acquisition and advisory services, the underwriting, distribution, trading, and brokerage of equity and debt securities, and the sale of mutual funds and other investment products. The firm also provides corporate and retail banking services and trust services. The firm operates predominantly in the United States (\"U.S.\") and, to a lesser extent, in Canada, the United Kingdom (\"UK\"), and other parts of Europe. As used herein, the terms \"our,\" \"we,\" or \"us\"","zh":"Raymond James Financial, Inc.（「RJF」或「公司」）是一家領先的多元化金融服務公司，為個人、企業和市政當局提供私人客戶群、資本市場、資產管理、銀行和其他服務。該公司及其子公司從事各種金融服務活動，包括向零售和機構客戶提供投資管理服務、併購和諮詢服務、股票和債務證券的承銷、分銷、交易和經紀，以及共同基金和其他投資產品的銷售。該公司還提供企業和零售銀行服務以及信託服務。該公司主要在美國（「美國」）運營，也有少量在加拿大、英國（「英國」）和歐洲其他地區運營。如本文所用，術語“我們的”、“我們的”或“我們的”"},{"en":"Established in 1962 and public since 1983, RJF is listed on the New York Stock Exchange (the \"NYSE\") under the symbol \"RJF.\" As a bank holding company (\"BHC\") and financial holding company (\"FHC\"), RJF is subject to supervision, examination and regulation by the Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System (\"the Fed\").","zh":"RJF 成立於 1962 年，自 1983 年起上市，在紐約證券交易所（「NYSE」）上市，股票代號為「RJF」。 RJF作為銀行控股公司（“BHC”）和金融控股公司（“FHC”），接受美國聯邦儲備系統理事會（“聯準會”）的監督、審查和監管。"},{"en":"Among the keys to our historical and continued success, our emphasis on putting the client first is at the core of our corporate values. We also believe in maintaining a long-term focus on our decision making. We believe that this disciplined decision-making approach translates to a strong, stable financial services firm for clients, associates, and shareholders.","zh":"在我們歷史上和持續成功的關鍵中，我們強調將客戶放在第一位，這是我們企業價值的核心。我們也相信要長期關注我們的決策。我們相信，這種嚴謹的決策方法將為客戶、員工和股東打造一家強大、穩定的金融服務公司。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We offer a broad range of third-party and proprietary investment products and services to meet our clients' various investment and financial needs. Revenues from this segment are typically driven by AUA and are generally either asset-based or transactional in nature.","zh":"我們提供廣泛的第三方和自營投資產品和服務，以滿足客戶的各種投資和金融需求。該部門的收入通常由 AUA 驅動，本質上通常是基於資產的或交易性的。"},{"en":"We earn asset management and related administrative fees in this segment for performing asset management, portfolio management, and related investment services for retail clients for assets invested in fee-based accounts.","zh":"我們在該部門賺取資產管理費和相關管理費，為零售客戶投資於收費帳戶的資產提供資產管理、投資組合管理和相關投資服務。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The financial services industry is intensely competitive. We compete with many other financial services firms, including a number of larger securities firms, most of which are affiliated with major financial services companies, insurance companies, banking institutions, and other organizations. We also compete with companies that offer web-based financial services and discount brokerage services to individual clients, usually with lower levels of service and financial technology companies (\"fintechs\"). We compete principally on the basis of the quality of our associates, services, technology platform, product selection, performance records, location, and reputation in local markets.","zh":"金融服務業競爭激烈。我們與許多其他金融服務公司競爭，包括一些較大的證券公司，其中大多數隸屬於主要金融服務公司、保險公司、銀行機構和其他組織。我們也與向個人客戶提供基於網路的金融服務和折扣經紀服務的公司競爭，這些公司通常是服務水準較低的金融科技公司（「金融科技公司」）。我們的競爭主要基於員工的品質、服務、技術平台、產品選擇、業績記錄、地理位置和在當地市場的聲譽。"},{"en":"Our ability to compete effectively is substantially dependent on our continuing ability to develop or attract, retain, and motivate qualified financial advisors, investment bankers, trading professionals, portfolio managers, and other revenue-producing or specialized personnel. Furthermore, the labor market continues to experience elevated levels of competition for talent across all areas of our business, as well as increased competition with non-traditional competitors, such as technology companies. Employers are offering guaranteed contracts, upfront payments, and increased compensation in order to attract talent.","zh":"我們有效競爭的能力在很大程度上取決於我們持續培養或吸引、保留和激勵合格的財務顧問、投資銀行家、交易專業人士、投資組合經理和其他創造收入或專業人才的能力。此外，勞動市場對我們所有業務領域的人才競爭持續加劇，與科技公司等非傳統競爭對手的競爭也日益激烈。雇主提供有保障的合約、預付款和增加薪資以吸引人才。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Private Client Group","val":10282000000,"zh":"私人客戶群"},{"name":"Rj Bank","val":3376000000,"zh":"Rj銀行"},{"name":"Capital Markets","val":1869000000,"zh":"資本市場"},{"name":"Asset Management","val":1188000000,"zh":"資產管理部門"}],"total":15912000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Asset Management & Related Administrative Fee Revenue","val":7078000000,"zh":"資產管理及相關管理費收入"},{"name":"Brokerage Revenue Securities Commissions","val":1775000000,"zh":"經紀收入 證券佣金"},{"name":"Account & Service Fee Revenue","val":1262000000,"zh":"帳戶及服務費收入"},{"name":"Investment Banking Revenue","val":1069000000,"zh":"投資銀行收入"},{"name":"Equities ET Fs & Fixed Income Products","val":650000000,"zh":"股票 ETF 和固定收益產品"},{"name":"Investment Banking Revenue Mergers & Acquisition & Advisory","val":623000000,"zh":"投資銀行收入 併購與諮詢"},{"name":"Brokerage Revenue Securities Commissions Mutual & Other Fund Products","val":614000000,"zh":"經紀收入 證券佣金 互惠及其他基金產品"},{"name":"Mutual Fund & Other","val":530000000,"zh":"共同基金及其他"},{"name":"Brokerage Revenue Securities Commissions Insurance & Annuity Products","val":511000000,"zh":"經紀收入 證券佣金 保險及年金產品"},{"name":"Account & Service Fee Revenue RJBDP Fees","val":486000000,"zh":"帳戶和服務費收入 RJBDP 費用"}],"total":15912000000}},"peers":["NTRS","WRB","AIZ","REG","AJG"]}}